d say well  you can only do it after you've gotten a  nobel prize which means it's a very  small population well okay it doesn't  have to be a nobel prize it could be  when your career has gelled to the point  where  you're now  recognized so that in fact if you're  going to make statements people will say  it's coming from some  authoritarian hate of sources build some  respect right younger people sometimes  say  um  i don't want to get involved in that i'm  in science to do science experiments  but when you grow up  okay and it is when you grow up and you  feel  assured of  a modicum of success  that you can go out and do this yeah  then you have to do it conscientiously  and seriously and honestly and you have  to bring rigorous science to what you do  thank you

